  "cover_text": "John Cohen will be the producer of Rovios self financed computer game series, Casino Remastered.\nCohen previously led the production of two mobile X-Box Actions series, “Bitter Birch” and “Series对抗为空走”， both were hugely successful titles for the series.\nHe has made promotional visits to 25 countries\nHe has also had more than 30 phone games published and has won games and software marketing awards internationally.\nRovios will be developing a series of Elite Editions for the PlayStation 4 and Xbox One series, also for Wii and Playstation Vita",
